  "description": "AutoFilterWpfDataGrid adds automatic, type-aware filter controls to every WPF DataGrid column — no templates, no converters, no manual UI work. Supports text, number, date, boolean, enum, Guid, TimeSpan, nullable types and automatic column sums. Free mode allows 1 active filter; full version unlocks unlimited filtering. Commercial license available at: https://markoee.gumroad.com/l/iyfupu",
